
== 1. LFUND issuer approves Maria (KYC passed); lime-owner sends her 50 LFUND; she adds liquidity
   Maria: 500000000 LP shares, 0 LFUND units left

== 2. Issuer freezes Maria's LFUND trustline (e.g. a sanctions hit)
   authorized: false

== 3. Without compliance mode (v1–v2 behaviour): Maria sells 1 unit of her LP claim to lime-owner
