   → the freeze is bypassed: LP shares are a claim on LFUND the SAC can't see

== 4. Compliance mode on: the same transfer, and a transfer to someone the issuer never approved
   ✗ rejected: Error(Contract, #14)
   ✗ rejected: Error(Contract, #14)
   (#14 = NotAuthorizedHolder)

